{"about_the_game":"<strong>CHAT WITH US ON DISCORD</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Before this object can function again, there\u2019s a lot of work to be done. With a set of various tools and your friend Amelia helping you out, you might be able to make it. Airport Renovator Prologue is an excellent introduction to the simulator game, where you start small and finish with a giant. <br><br><br><strong>Get to work</strong><br>Your toolset includes an axe, an air-blower, a grass trimmer, a power washer, and more! With the dynamic in-game environment, you\u2019ll always have your hands full. There\u2019s nothing more satisfying than blowing sand off the airfield before a plane touches down. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Airdrops</strong><br><br>Friendly pilot Amelia will be dropping loot crates for you once in a while. Smash them with your axe, and don\u2019t hesitate to use whatever you find inside. It can be anything from tools, airport equipment items to surprises that you surely won\u2019t expect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Plan and equip</strong><br><br>You\u2019re starting with a small airport and, if you run things well, you will finish with a massive, international one! Plan out where you\u2019re going to place the airport items you\u2019ve received and see the business thrive. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight against the forces of nature</strong><br>This place has been abandoned for years, and nature has taken over. It\u2019s up to you to fight against the overgrown vegetation in constantly changing weather conditions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/AIRPORT_GIF_4.gif?t=1707989050\" /></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Visit us on Discord -&gt;</strong> ","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1770010?t=1707989050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1707989050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1707989050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1707989050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>WE RECOMMEND YOU TO CHECK THESE GAMES...</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>CHAT WITH US ON DISCORD</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Before this object can function again, there\u2019s a lot of work to be done. With a set of various tools and your friend Amelia helping you out, you might be able to make it. Airport Renovator Prologue is an excellent introduction to the simulator game, where you start small and finish with a giant. <br><br><br><strong>Get to work</strong><br>Your toolset includes an axe, an air-blower, a grass trimmer, a power washer, and more! With the dynamic in-game environment, you\u2019ll always have your hands full. There\u2019s nothing more satisfying than blowing sand off the airfield before a plane touches down. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Airdrops</strong><br><br>Friendly pilot Amelia will be dropping loot crates for you once in a while. Smash them with your axe, and don\u2019t hesitate to use whatever you find inside. It can be anything from tools, airport equipment items to surprises that you surely won\u2019t expect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Plan and equip</strong><br><br>You\u2019re starting with a small airport and, if you run things well, you will finish with a massive, international one! Plan out where you\u2019re going to place the airport items you\u2019ve received and see the business thrive. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.poster.avif?t=1707989050\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.webm?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.mp4?t=1707989050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight against the forces of nature</strong><br>This place has been abandoned for years, and nature has taken over. It\u2019s up to you to fight against the overgrown vegetation in constantly changing weather conditions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/extras/AIRPORT_GIF_4.gif?t=1707989050\" /></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Visit us on Discord -&gt;</strong> ","developers":["Two Horizons"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770010/header.jpg?t=1707989050","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1770010/405897/1e7035f1ffdeb437727317ef415c32e903825558/1751030143/dash_av1.mpd?t=1633098939","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1770010/405897/1e7035f1ffdeb437727317ef415c32e903825558/1751030143/dash_h264.mpd?t=1633098939","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1770010/405897/1e7035f1ffdeb437727317ef415c32e903825558/